language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario CommitProduction.
condition CommitProductionReady.
condition CommitProductionContinue.
condition CommitProductionReject.
outcome CommitProductionCompleted.
outcome CommitProductionRejected.
step CommitProductionCapture.
step CommitProductionCommit.
step CommitProductionPublish.
step CommitProductionObserve.
step CommitProductionFailure.
step CommitProductionSuccess.
condition ProductionDeliveryPending.
condition ProductionLabAvailable.
condition ProductionLabAbsent.
condition ProductionLabFailed.
outcome ProductionStoredDeliveryPending.
outcome ProductionStoredWithoutLab.
step ReportProductionDeliveryPending.
step CompleteProductionWithoutLab.

CommitProduction illustrates RecordProduction.
CommitProduction exercises DurableProduction.
CommitProduction starts-when CommitProductionReady.
CommitProduction starts-at CommitProductionCapture.
CommitProductionReady describes "A cut fact is accepted with current domain context.".
CommitProductionContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
CommitProductionReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
CommitProductionCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
CommitProductionRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
CommitProduction preserves DurableFactsRetained.
CommitProduction preserves DomainTruthOwned.
CommitProductionCapture calls ValidateCutContext within BuckingService.
CommitProductionCapture describes "Bind calibration/policy/economic/APT/model/plan/input revisions; fail if missing.".
CommitProductionCapture proceeds-to CommitProductionFailure when CommitProductionReject.
CommitProductionCapture proceeds-to CommitProductionCommit when CommitProductionContinue.
CommitProductionCommit calls RecordProductionFact within BuckingService.
CommitProductionCommit describes "Persist authoritative production record with explicit failure/recovery contract.".
CommitProductionCommit proceeds-to CommitProductionFailure when CommitProductionReject.
CommitProductionCommit proceeds-to CommitProductionPublish when CommitProductionContinue.
CommitProductionPublish calls PublishBuckingState within BuckingService.
CommitProductionPublish describes "Non-supersedable event; observers do not become the store.".
CommitProductionPublish proceeds-to ReportProductionDeliveryPending when ProductionDeliveryPending.
CommitProductionPublish proceeds-to CommitProductionObserve when ProductionLabAvailable.
CommitProductionPublish proceeds-to CompleteProductionWithoutLab when ProductionLabAbsent.
CommitProductionObserve calls ObserveBuckingHistory within BuckingLab.
CommitProductionObserve describes "Optional diagnostic record may be absent without changing production authority.".
CommitProductionObserve proceeds-to CompleteProductionWithoutLab when ProductionLabFailed.
CommitProductionObserve proceeds-to CommitProductionSuccess when CommitProductionContinue.
CommitProductionFailure finishes CommitProduction with CommitProductionRejected.
CommitProductionSuccess finishes CommitProduction with CommitProductionCompleted.
CommitProductionPublish emits BuckingResponses through BuckingServiceUpstream.
CommitProductionObserve receives BuckingResponses through BuckingServiceUpstream.
ProductionDeliveryPending describes "The authoritative fact is stored but event publication/delivery has not succeeded; retry/recovery must retain the fact and identity.".
ProductionLabAvailable describes "Event publication succeeded and the optional Lab observer is available.".
ProductionLabAbsent describes "Event publication succeeded and no Lab observer is configured or available.".
ProductionLabFailed describes "The optional Lab failed to record the event; authoritative production success is unchanged.".
ReportProductionDeliveryPending finishes CommitProduction with ProductionStoredDeliveryPending.
CompleteProductionWithoutLab finishes CommitProduction with ProductionStoredWithoutLab.
ProductionStoredDeliveryPending describes "Durable production commit succeeded; delivery recovery remains pending, never implicit rollback.".
ProductionStoredWithoutLab describes "Durable production commit and publication succeeded; optional diagnostic evidence is absent.".
